    "long_instructions": "#Step 1: Generate It.\r\n\r\n1. Create three images using nearly the same prompt.\r\n\r\n\t- Which one looks most real at first glance?\r\n\r\n#Step 2: Stress Test It.\r\n\r\n2. Push the image toward real-world details.\r\n\r\n\t- Show people actually using it\r\n\r\n\t- Add labels or text\r\n\r\n\t- Put it in a real setting\r\n\r\n\t- Zoom in on details\r\n\r\n**Does it stay consistent?\r\nOr does it start to fall apart?**",
